Subject: [PATCH 6/6] J714s developer image (upstream): linux-aurora up273-10
 (integration/aurora e661192638a3, external DCP PHY softdep)

linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora17.up273-10 (aurora-silicon/linux integration/aurora e661192638a3 plus
betizzel/omarchy-m5 patches/upstream-27.3/0001, 0004, 0005, 0008 and 0009, appledrm soft-depending
on atc-t6050-dp), recipe at betizzel/omarchy-m5 152b6ef. The J714s kernel pins follow the new
release 7.3.0-17.up273-10-ARCH. Aura (m1n1-aurora up273-3) and the other packages unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
